## 8. Summary of net changes vs the previous draft

**Added:** delete broken constants (3.1) · single source of truth + self-check (3.2) · anchor load to history (3.3) · progression-block state (3.4) · coverage scales with days×duration (3.5) · empty-injury = no-op (3.6) · expanded metadata (section 6) · cited evidence (section 7).
**Revised:** priority order (recovery above focus muscles) · rep range removed from variation levers · wide bands replace the narrow deterministic table · "heavy" hinge defined.
**Open:** does the generator receive per-exercise load history + block position? (Gates 3.3 / 3.4.)